WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
Good morning, Hank, it's Sunday, it's News Day,

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.800
and that means it's time to get on board the Fail Boat,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.980
with our intrepid captain, the Dread Fireball Wilson Roberts!

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:10.580
Hank, the Fail Boat is of course the puppy-captained, questionably seaworthy vessel

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.700
that we Nerdfighters use to transport ourselves around the various islands

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.400
of our archipelagic empire known as Nerdfighteria.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.020
And that we also use to sail around the world learning about places currently experiencing World Suck.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.460
Where to first, Skipper?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.600
Willie says, "Aye Italia!"

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.900
Yes, Hank, first we're sailing the Fail Boat off to Italy,

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.040
and then...walking 8 miles inland to the Vatican,

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:36.960
where there has, lately, been quite a lot of hullabaloo over a certain quasi-bishop named Richard Williamson.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:41.820
Hank, Richard Williamson is a crazy person, who, until recently, was excommunicated from the Catholic Church

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.060
on account of his being...crazy.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.680
But then recently, Pope Benedict lifted the excommunication so that they could possibly begin the

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:52.700
process of rehabilitating this dude into the church so he could be a bishop again.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:55.680
And a lot of people are upset about this because Richard Williamson

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.020
has repeatedly denied that the Holocaust involved the murder of 6 million Jews.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.740
Now, thanks to the public outcry, Williamson has agreed to

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.100
"reconsider the historical evidence" of the Holocaust.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:10.980
Which is like reconsidering the historic evidence that America had a president called Ronald Reagan.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:14.960
So my guess is that Richard Williamson wants to be a bishop and so he's gonna say, okay,

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.040
there was a Holocaust, I'm sorry, and then maybe he's gonna get rehabilitated.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.420
Which would be an error, because in addition to being a Holocaust denier,

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:25.180
Richard Williamson also has a lot of crazy beliefs.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.420
Like, for instance, that women should not be allowed to go to college.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.800
And perhaps most importantly,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.600
Richard Williamson believes that women should not be allowed to wear pants.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.400
Mister Williamson, when you try to take away our ladies' pants,

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.360
we here in Nerdfighteria take that quite personally.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.480
Let me explain something to you, sir.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.840
The book title '"Everything That Rises Must Converge" - in your pants?'

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.760
is funny.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:50.040
The book title '"Everything that rises must converge" -

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.440
in the 19th century hoopskirt that was designed explicitly to limit your movement,

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.000
and thereby rob you of your power?'

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:56.880
is NOT funny.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.820
And Richard Williamson, you, bishop or no, will NOT take away my in-your-pants-jokes.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.040
Next stop on the Fail Boat...[gets interrupted by dog barking]

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.640
Oh, Captain Fireball, do you have something you wanna say to would-be-bishop Williamson?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.880
[Dog barks]

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.440
Oh my, you tiny, white, fluffy pirates sure do have dirty mouths.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.360
I wouldn't have used *those* words, but,

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.840
I do agree with the sentiment.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.740
Where to next, oh Captain, my Captain?

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.280
[barks again] Very well then.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.060
Full speed ahead to Australia!

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.660
In "Just because it's cold in *your* house doesn't mean Global Warming is a lie" News,

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:32.600
the deadliest wildfires in the history of Australia are currently raging in the south of the country.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:38.420
So, Hank, for the last little while, it has been really hot and really dry and really windy in Australia,

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.220
like a 117 °Fahrenheit (47 °C) hot.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:46.020
And these conditions have combined with what is, in at least some cases, apparent arson, to create

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:48.500
epicly horrible wildfires.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.140
Hundreds of square miles of wilderness has burned, entire towns have been destroyed,

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.200
and many people have lost their lives.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.440
Hank, you and I have many friends and fellow Nerdfighters,

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.920
who, when they're not wintering in Nerdfighteria, live in Southern Australia.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.640
I know that we're both concerned about them,

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.120
and I hope that they know that our thoughts and prayers are with them.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.540
Hank? This is yourself -

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:10.480
or possibly me wearing a you-costume in attempt to cheer up Australian Nerdfighters.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.000
For Captain Fireball Roberts and the whole crew of the Fail Boat,

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.140
this is Hank Green saying "Best Wishes!"

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.480
Why yes, I DO also have a me-disguise.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:25.760
By the way, thank you to the Nerdfighter who made this - but why did I get Kim Jong-Il's haircut?

